Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(migrations): cancel only refresh jobs that actually
 snoozed

MetadataBackfill inserts scheduled per-item MetadataRefresh rows that never snooze. Restrict the cancellation to rows whose meta carries the snoozed key, per CodeRabbit on #1150.
---
